Constructors
• Constructor declaration public class Account {
private String name;
• Default constructor private float balance;
public Account() {
• Constructor overloading name = "default";
balance = 100;
}
• Constructor chaining
public Account(String name) {
• Private constructor this.name = name;
balance = 100;
}
• How about destructors? public Account(String name, float balance) {
this.name = name;
this.balance = balance;
}
}
